{
  "id": "DEU.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Kumbukumbu La Sheria 20",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkienda vitani kupigana na adui zenu, mkaona farasi, magari na jeshi kubwa zaidi kuliko lenu msiwaogope. Maana Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu aliyewatoa Misri, atakuwa nanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabla ya kuanza mapigano, kuhani atajitokeza mbele na kuwaambia watu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Watu wa Israeli sikilizeni! Leo mnakaribia kupigana dhidi ya adui zenu. Msife moyo, au kuogopa, au kutishika, au kuwaogopa adui; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maana Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, ndiye atakayekwenda pamoja nanyi kupigana kwa niaba yenu dhidi ya adui zenu na kuwapa ushindi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kisha maofisa watawaambia watu: ‘Kuna mtu yeyote hapa aliyejenga nyumba mpya lakini hajaizindua? Arudi nyumbani, asije akafia vitani na mtu mwingine akaizindua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna mtu yeyote hapa aliyepanda mizabibu na ambaye hajafurahia matunda yake ya kwanza? Arudi nyumbani asije akafia vitani na mtu mwingine akafurahia matunda yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna mwanamume yeyote hapa aliyeposa na yuko karibu kuoa? Arudi nyumbani, asije akafia vitani, na mwanamume mwingine akaoa mchumba wake.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maofisa wataendelea kuwaambia watu, ‘Je, yupo hapa mtu aliyekufa moyo? Arudi nyumbani, asije akasababisha wenzake kufa moyo kama yeye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maofisa wakisha sema na watu, basi makamanda watawaongoza watu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mnapokaribia mji kuushambulia, kwanza wapeni wakazi wake masharti ya amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakazi wa mji huo wakitaka amani na kujisalimisha kwenu, basi watu wote waliomo humo watawatumikieni na kufanya kazi za kulazimishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wakazi wa mji huo wasipofanya amani nanyi, lakini wakapigana vita nanyi, basi, mtauzingira mji wao; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu akiutia mikononi mwenu, mtawaua kwa upanga wanaume wote; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lakini wanawake na watoto, ng'ombe, na vyote vilivyomo mjini, nyara zake zote mwaweza kuchukua mateka kwa ajili yenu wenyewe; mnaweza kufurahia nyara za adui zenu, ambazo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, amewapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndivyo mtakavyoitendea miji yote ambayo iko mbali na nchi mtakayoimiliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini katika miji ya nchi ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, anawapeni, msisalimishe chochote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtawaangamiza watu wote: Wahiti, Waamori, Wakanaani, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi kama Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, alivyoamuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasije wakawafundisha desturi zao za kuchukiza ambazo waliifanyia miungu yao, nanyi mkatenda dhambi dhidi ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkiuzingira mji kwa muda mrefu, mkapigana kuuteka, msiiharibu miti ya matunda kwa mashoka. Je, miti ni watu hata muishambulie? Mnaweza kula matunda ya miti hiyo, lakini msiikate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnaweza kukata tu miti mingine kuitumia kuuzingira mji mpaka muuteke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
